  ('ENG10-AN-003', 'Bahasa Inggris Kelas X', 'announcements', 'Announcements & Service Advisories', 'sulit', 'C4', 'announcement', 'METRO CITY TRANSIT AUTHORITY — SERVICE ADVISORY: WEEKEND RAIL TRACK MAINTENANCE

