(1) The track maintenance will take place every weekend throughout November 2026.
(2) Blue Line train service will be paused between 6:00 AM and 10:00 PM over the weekend.
(3) Passengers must purchase special shuttle passes at Central Station before boarding.
(4) Complimentary shuttle buses will run every fifteen minutes to serve affected stations.
(5) Normal subway schedules will restart on Monday morning at 5:00 AM.', '[{"key":"A","text":"Statements (1), (3), and (5)"},{"key":"B","text":"Statements (1), (2), and (4)"},{"key":"C","text":"Statements (2), (4), and (5)"},{"key":"D","text":"Statements (3), (4), and (5)"},{"key":"E","text":"Statements (2), (3), and (4)"}]'::jsonb, 'C', 'Eliminate "every weekend" (only Nov 14–15) and paid shuttle passes ("Free shuttle buses").', 'Statements (2), (4), and (5) match the announcement directly. Statement (1) wrongly expands a single weekend into every weekend, and (3) contradicts "Free shuttle buses."', ARRAY['announcement', 'complex-mcq', 'hots']::text[]),
  ('ENG10-AN-004', 'Bahasa Inggris Kelas X', 'announcements', 'Announcements & Service Advisories', 'medium', 'C3', 'announcement', 'GLOBAL TECH ACADEMY × NORDIC UNIVERSITY OF TECHNOLOGY

ANNOUNCING THE FAST-TRACK B.SC. IN DATA SCIENCE PATHWAY

We are excited to launch an exclusive academic partnership with Nordic University of Technology, Stockholm, offering a direct Bachelor of Science degree pathway for Global Tech Academy diploma holders.

• Students who have completed our 2-Year Applied Computing Diploma can now earn an accredited bachelor''s degree in just 12 months.
• Delivered 100% online through practical capstone projects with no traditional written final exams.
• Affordable tuition fee of €1,800 – €2,200 for the entire final year, with flexible monthly installment plans.

Designed for working professionals and ambitious graduates, this pathway bridges practical coding skills with internationally recognized academic credentials. Applications for the Spring Intake close on December 15. Visit globaltechacademy.edu for details.', 'A student has finished the 2-Year Applied Computing Diploma at Global Tech Academy and wants a bachelor''s degree. Based on the notice, what option is available?', '[{"key":"A","text":"Receive a master''s degree automatically without completing any capstone projects."},{"key":"B","text":"Enroll in a three-year on-campus engineering program in Stockholm free of charge."},{"key":"C","text":"Take traditional written exams at Global Tech Academy to earn university credits."},{"key":"D","text":"Apply for a full government scholarship covering all living expenses in Sweden."},{"key":"E","text":"Complete an accredited bachelor''s degree online in one year through Nordic University."}]'::jsonb, 'E', 'Read the first two bullet points detailing duration ("12 months") and delivery format ("100% online").', 'Diploma holders can earn an accredited Bachelor of Science degree through Nordic University in just 12 months (one year), delivered 100% online.', ARRAY['announcement', 'application', 'global-tech']::text[]),
