Designed for working professionals and ambitious graduates, this pathway bridges practical coding skills with internationally recognized academic credentials. Applications for the Spring Intake close on December 15. Visit globaltechacademy.edu for details.', 'Which three statements accurately match the details in the Global Tech Academy partnership announcement?
(1) Diploma graduates can complete an accredited bachelor’s degree within 12 months.
(2) All applicants are guaranteed a 50% merit scholarship from Nordic University.
(3) The program is conducted entirely online and evaluates students via capstone projects.
(4) Students must travel to Stockholm at the end of the year to sit for written exams.
(5) Tuition for the final year ranges between €1,800 and €2,200 with installment options.', '[{"key":"A","text":"Statements (1), (3), and (5)"},{"key":"B","text":"Statements (2), (3), and (4)"},{"key":"C","text":"Statements (3), (4), and (5)"},{"key":"D","text":"Statements (1), (4), and (5)"},{"key":"E","text":"Statements (1), (2), and (5)"}]'::jsonb, 'A', 'Eliminate mentions of a guaranteed 50% scholarship (not stated) and traveling for written exams ("no traditional written final exams").', 'Statements (1), (3), and (5) come straight from the three bullet points in the announcement.', ARRAY['announcement', 'complex-mcq', 'hots']::text[]),
