Dear Nature Enthusiasts,

Discover how rainforest flora and nocturnal wildlife come alive after sunset! Join our trained botanists and park rangers for a special small-group evening walking expedition this month.

• Schedule: Every Friday & Saturday evening, 6:30 PM – 8:45 PM
• Meeting Point: Orchid Pavilion Main Gate (please arrive 20 minutes early for safety briefing)
• Group Limit: Maximum 18 visitors per session (minimum age 10 years)
• Fee: IDR 75,000 per participant (includes reusable red-light headlamp and herbal tea)

For animal safety, flash photography and bright white smartphone flashlights are strictly prohibited along forest trails. Closed-toe walking shoes are mandatory. Reserve tickets online at bogorconservatory.id.', 'At what time should reserved participants arrive at the Orchid Pavilion Main Gate for the tour?', '[{"key":"A","text":"Promptly at 6:30 PM when the forest gates open."},{"key":"B","text":"At 7:00 PM after having dinner at the botanical cafe."},{"key":"C","text":"At 8:45 PM when park rangers finish counting visitors."},{"key":"D","text":"Every Sunday morning twenty minutes before sunrise."},{"key":"E","text":"No later than 6:10 PM so they can attend the safety briefing."}]'::jsonb, 'E', 'Calculate 20 minutes prior to the 6:30 PM schedule.', 'The tour begins at 6:30 PM and asks visitors to "arrive 20 minutes early for safety briefing," which is 6:10 PM.', ARRAY['announcement', 'detail', 'conservatory']::text[]),
