Be a Lifesaver This Saturday!

Harapan Community Hospital, together with the Regional Red Cross Unit, invites healthy community members to join our semi-annual blood donation campaign to replenish city hospital reserves before the holiday travel season.

• Date & Venue: Saturday, December 12, 2026 | 8:30 AM – 2:30 PM | Hospital West Wing Atrium
• Donor Requirements: Aged 17–60 years, body weight at least 48 kg, and well rested (minimum 5 hours of sleep)
• Complimentary Benefits: Free blood pressure screening, iron-level check, nutritious recovery meal box, and a digital donor badge

Walk-in donors are welcome, though booking a 30-minute time slot via harapancare.org/donate helps eliminate waiting time. Please bring a valid national ID or student ID card and eat a light meal beforehand.', 'Why are Harapan Community Hospital and the Regional Red Cross holding the weekend drive?', '[{"key":"A","text":"To charge walk-in visitors for mandatory iron-level tests."},{"key":"B","text":"To replace national identity cards with digital health badges."},{"key":"C","text":"To replenish city hospital blood supplies ahead of the holiday travel season."},{"key":"D","text":"To train medical interns in setting up outdoor mobile clinics."},{"key":"E","text":"To celebrate the opening of a new cafeteria inside the East Wing."}]'::jsonb, 'C', 'Read the opening sentence following "Be a Lifesaver This Saturday!".', 'The campaign aims "to replenish city hospital reserves before the holiday travel season."', ARRAY['announcement', 'purpose', 'hospital']::text[]),
