  ('ENG10-VT-031', 'Bahasa Inggris Kelas X', 'verb-tenses', 'Verb Tenses (Present, Past & Perfect)', 'medium', 'C3', 'text', 'Yesterday evening was quite chaotic at the community center. The volunteers were arranging chairs in the hall, and the technician was testing the microphone. While Sarah … the welcome banner on the stage, the power suddenly … out and plunged the room into darkness. Everyone immediately turned on their phone flashlights.', 'The correct verb forms to complete the paragraph are ….', '[{"key":"A","text":"hung – was going"},{"key":"B","text":"was hanging – went"},{"key":"C","text":"is hanging – goes"},{"key":"D","text":"had hung – goes"},{"key":"E","text":"has hung – went"}]'::jsonb, 'B', 'A continuous past action ("While Sarah...") was interrupted by a sudden blackout ("suddenly...").', '"While Sarah was hanging" (Past Continuous) sets up the ongoing past task interrupted by the sudden blackout "went out" (Simple Past).', ARRAY['verb-tenses', 'past-continuous', 'sas-x']::text[]),
  ('ENG10-VT-032', 'Bahasa Inggris Kelas X', 'verb-tenses', 'Verb Tenses (Present, Past & Perfect)', 'mudah', 'C2', 'text', 'My older sister is a dedicated marine biologist at a coastal research institute. She loves studying coral reef ecosystems in eastern Indonesia. She … at the institute for seven years, and she still … diving into the ocean every week. Many university students read her published papers on reef restoration.', 'The correct verb forms to complete the paragraph are ….', '[{"key":"A","text":"had worked – enjoy"},{"key":"B","text":"has worked – enjoys"},{"key":"C","text":"worked – is enjoying"},{"key":"D","text":"is working – enjoyed"},{"key":"E","text":"works – has enjoyed"}]'::jsonb, 'B', 'Look at "for seven years" (she still works there now) alongside "every week" (habitual present).', '"Has worked" (Present Perfect) shows duration continuing up to the present, and "enjoys" (Simple Present) matches her weekly routine.', ARRAY['verb-tenses', 'present-perfect', 'simple-present', 'sas-x']::text[]),
  ('ENG10-VT-033', 'Bahasa Inggris Kelas X', 'verb-tenses', 'Verb Tenses (Present, Past & Perfect)', 'medium', 'C3', 'text', 'Last Saturday, my friends and I planned to catch the morning express train to Yogyakarta. Unfortunately, our taxi got stuck in heavy traffic near the highway tollgate. When we finally rushed onto the station platform, the train … five minutes earlier. We had to buy tickets for the afternoon departure instead.', 'The correct verb form to complete the paragraph is ….', '[{"key":"A","text":"was already departing"},{"key":"B","text":"has already departed"},{"key":"C","text":"had already departed"},{"key":"D","text":"already departed"},{"key":"E","text":"is already departing"}]'::jsonb, 'C', 'Notice "five minutes earlier" prior to "When we finally rushed onto the station platform."', 'Past Perfect ("had already departed") shows the train left five minutes before they reached the platform in the past.', ARRAY['verb-tenses', 'past-perfect', 'sas-x']::text[]),
  ('ENG10-VT-034', 'Bahasa Inggris Kelas X', 'verb-tenses', 'Verb Tenses (Present, Past & Perfect)', 'sulit', 'C4', 'text', 'Remembering passwords for multiple online accounts can be tricky. I … my email password three times this month, which is quite annoying. Fortunately, last year I … a single password during the entire school semester. My older brother suggested using a secure password manager app.', 'The correct verb forms to complete the paragraph are ….', '[{"key":"A","text":"reset – have not forgotten"},{"key":"B","text":"have reset – am not forgetting"},{"key":"C","text":"had reset – have not forgotten"},{"key":"D","text":"have reset – did not forget"},{"key":"E","text":"was resetting – do not forget"}]'::jsonb, 'D', '"Three times this month" covers an unfinished time frame up to now; "last year" refers to a finished past period.', 'Repeated actions within an unfinished month ("this month") take Present Perfect ("have reset"), while "last year" requires Simple Past ("did not forget").', ARRAY['verb-tenses', 'present-perfect', 'simple-past', 'hots', 'sas-x']::text[]),
  ('ENG10-VT-035', 'Bahasa Inggris Kelas X', 'verb-tenses', 'Verb Tenses (Present, Past & Perfect)', 'medium', 'C3', 'none', NULL, 'Complete the sentence using the correct forms of ACHIEVE and LAUNCH!
